  "description": "The runtime adapter that bridges CircleAI.Aether contracts to the live\n      AetherNet protocol. Implements IAetherContext (presence/capability),\n      IAetherTelemetry (event fan-out from real mesh events), and\n      ISecurityDirectiveConsumer (forwards AI-issued directives to\n      AetherNet.Security's policy engine).\n\n      Floats AetherNet.* with Version=\"1.*\" so patch/minor upstream releases\n      flow through to consumers without re-pin.",
